<title>USA: U.S. Spring/White Wheat - Spring bids mixed.</title>
<headline>U.S. Spring/White Wheat - Spring bids mixed.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dark northern spring wheat cash prices were mixed on Monday in featureless activity while wheat wheat values firmed, merchandisers said.</p>
<p>Dealers cited some movement in parts of North Dakota and Montana and noted a lack of export demand.</p>
<p>In the Pacific Northwest, interest in wheat was also slow. &quot;There were no big sales. Farmers do not want to sell wheat,&quot; an Oregon merchandiser said.</p>
<p>MGE March wheat firmed 1/4 cent to end at $3.82-1/2 a bushel.  </p>
